  "body": "## Finding description and impact\n\n**Description:** `MinterUpgradeable.update_period()` always mints and transfers `_gauge` HYBR to `GaugeManager.notifyRewardAmount`. When `IVoter.totalWeight()` is zero, `_ratio` stays zero, so `index` never increases and `claimable[gauge]` remains unchanged. The minted tokens accumulate in the gauge manager with no mechanism to distribute or claw them back.\n\n**Impact:** Any actor can call `update_period()` during an epoch where nobody has voted (e.g., launch week or after a mass `reset`). A full epoch’s emissions are stranded inside `GaugeManager`, starving all gauges and breaking the incentives while all transactions appear successful.\n\n## Recommended mitigation steps\n\n**Recommended Mitigation:** In `notifyRewardAmount`, if `totalWeight == 0` either refund the tokens to the minter/treasury or queue them until voting resumes (e.g., keep a separate “unallocated” bucket and retry next epoch).",
  "proof_of_concept": "**Proof of Concept:**\nHow to run\n- `forge test --match-test submissionValidity -vvv`\n\n```javascript\n// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\npragma solidity 0.8.13;\n\nimport \"forge-std/Test.sol\";\n\nimport {C4PoCTestbed} from \"./C4PoCTestbed.t.sol\";\n\ncontract C4PoC is C4PoCTestbed {\n    function setUp() public override {\n        super.setUp();\n    }\n\n    function test_submissionValidity() external {\n        // Ensure no one has voted yet\n        uint256 totalWeight = voter.totalWeight();\n        assertEq(totalWeight, 0, \"total weight should start at zero\");\n\n        uint256 week = minter.WEEK();\n        uint256 activePeriod = minter.active_period();\n        vm.warp(activePeriod + week + 1);\n\n        uint256 balanceBefore = hybr.balanceOf(address(gaugeManager));\n        minter.update_period();\n\n        uint256 balanceAfter = hybr.balanceOf(address(gaugeManager));\n        uint256 minted = balanceAfter - balanceBefore;\n        assertGt(minted, 0, \"minter did not transfer emissions\");\n\n        // Subsequent distribution attempts cannot move the stuck emissions\n        gaugeManager.distributeAll();\n        assertEq(hybr.balanceOf(address(gaugeManager)), balanceAfter, \"manager balance changed unexpectedly\");\n    }\n}\n```",
